,{"text":"pure","start":108.9,"end":109.08},{"text":"spirit.","start":109.08,"end":110.06},{"text":"Mother,","start":113.18,"end":113.9},{"text":"I","start":113.9,"end":114.04},{"text":"am","start":114.04,"end":114.22},{"text":"the","start":114.22,"end":114.38},{"text":"spirit.","start":114.38,"end":115.2}]},{"text":"We can bring our attention to our breathing. We breathe in through our nose, and we can hold it there.","start":122.38,"end":132.9,"words":[{"text":"We","start":122.38,"end":122.52},{"text":"can","start":122.52,"end":122.52},{"text":"bring","start":122.52,"end":122.68},{"text":"our","start":122.68,"end":122.92},{"text":"attention","start":122.92,"end":123.2},{"text":"to","start":123.2,"end":123.5},{"text":"our","start":123.5,"end":123.6},{"text":"breathing.","start":123.6,"end":124.26},{"text":"We","start":125.52,"end":125.76},{"text":"breathe","start":125.76,"end":126.12},{"text":"in","start":126.12,"end":126.4},{"text":"through","start":126.4,"end":126.56},{"text":"our","start":126.56,"end":126.78},{"text":"nose,","start":126.78,"end":127.58},{"text":"and","start":131.68,"end":131.82},{"text":"we","start":131.82,"end":131.86},{"text":"can","start":131.86,"end":132.06},{"text":"hold","start":132.06,"end":132.24},{"text":"it","start":132.24,"end":132.46},{"text":"there.","start":132.46,"end":132.9}]},{"text":"And after a few seconds, we can exhale through our mouth, and again hold it once we've exhaled all our air, and breathe in.","start":137.08,"end":150.54,"words":[{"text":"And","start":137.08,"end":137.36},{"text":"after","start":137.36,"end":137.5},{"text":"a","start":137.5,"end":137.78},{"text":"few","start":137.78,"end":137.8},{"text":"seconds,","start":137.8,"end":138.6},{"text":"we","start":138.6,"end":138.6},{"text":"can","start":138.6,"end":139.18},{"text":"exhale","start":139.18,"end":139.58},{"text":"through","start":139.58,"end":139.94},{"text":"our","start":139.94,"end":140.3},{"text":"mouth,","start":140.3,"end":140.78},{"text":"and","st